"merged_at":"2026-03-06T18:46:17Z"},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Implements gRPC server for the job worker service with full mTLS support\n- Extracts client identity (UserID, IsAdmin) from peer certificates using CN and OU fields\n- Maps domain errors to appropriate gRPC status codes via interceptors\n- Adds all WorkerService RPCs: StartJob, StopJob, GetJobStatus, StreamOutput\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Run unit tests: `go test ./internal/server/...`\n- [ ] Run integration test (requires root): `sudo go test -v ./internal/server/... -run TestIntegration`\n- [ ] Verify mTLS with generated certificates in `certs/` directory","closed_by":{"login":"chintamanil","id":6878381,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NzgzODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6878381?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil","html_url":"https://github.com/chintamanil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chintamanil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chintamanil/job-worker/issues/6/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chintamanil/job-worker/issues/6/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chintamanil/job-worker/issues/5"